c-valley-now-live",["sourceVersion"]="faction-source-context-2026-10-26-r1",["text"]="The Stormpike Guard was the Alliance force in Alterac Valley, where Vanndar Stormpike commanded its defense.",["title"]="Stormpike Guard"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_PRIMARY_ARTICLE_READ",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["receiptID"]="classic-warsong-alterac",["receiptSHA256"]="462b13541a913d87a606c27d53826b6fcb1afacf61e6c6da0f2f468ae961e4f5"},["field"]="role",["id"]="faction-frostwolf-clan",["kind"]="faction",["newSubject"]=true,["related"]={"atlas-instance-alterac-valley"},["sourceURL"]="https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/23237900/wow-classic-warsong-gulch-and-alterac-valley-now-live",["sourceVersion"]="faction-source-context-2026-10-26-r1",["text"]="The Frostwolf Clan was the Horde force in Alterac Valley, commanded by Drek’Thar.",["title"]="Frostwolf Clan"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"476:description:1-39","476:description:44-119","476:description:122-221","476:description:224-317","476:description:322-389","476:description:392-425","476:description:428-507","476:objective:1-42"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=476,["sourceHash"]="2e4adfcc0385abb257e5a0bfc5cf1107ce241325ddee2d5566e42ef130bd2f02"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="history",["id"]="faction-gnarlpine",["kind"]="faction",["newSubject"]=true,["related"]={},["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="faction-source-context-2026-10-26-r1",["text"]="Gaerolas described the Gnarlpines as formerly peaceful furbolgs driven mad by their chieftain Ursal through the power of Fel Moss.",["title"]="Gnarlpine"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"476:description:1-39","476:description:44-119","476:description:122-221","476:description:224-317","476:description:32