of spreading corruption to creatures throughout the land, opposing the Emerald Circle’s work of healing Felwood.",["title"]="Jadefire"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4505:description:1-45","4505:description:47-161","4505:description:166-271","4505:description:273-399","4505:description:404-460","4505:description:462-494","4505:objective:1-120"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4505,["sourceHash"]="1a41002a00b0a94ff8d34b61d663d6c87df398bf92847d2ef7eba4dd86e38657"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="faction-jadefire",["kind"]="faction",["newSubject"]=false,["related"]={},["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="faction-source-context-2026-10-26-r1",["text"]="Winna Hazzard described the corrupted Constellas moonwell as a means of bringing forth more satyrs and sought a sample of its water for her own experiment.",["title"]="Jadefire"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"4421:description:1-31","4421:description:33-86","4421:description:91-189","4421:description:194-301","4421:description:303-421","4421:description:426-469","4421:description:471-511","4421:objective:1-88","4421:objective:90-159"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=4421,["sourceHash"]="e79343c55989f3d1f87ee7db2352032c40834b1d381a131c6fc4fb7ddaa5da7f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="role",["id"]="faction-emerald-circle",["kind"]="faction",["newSubject"]=true,["related"]={},["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="faction-source-context-2026-10-26-r1",["text"]="Eridan Bluewind identified himself with the Emerald Circle and its effort to heal Felwood’s indiscriminate corruption.",["title"]="Emerald Circle"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5155:description:1-75","5155:description:80-188","5155:description:193-219","5155:description:221-272","5155:description:274-332","5155:description:337-422","5155:description:424-459","5155:description:461-503","5155:objective:1-154"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5155,["sourceHash"]="c8a501ff11426aa12fa21fc4672f051cb4ab37d85693bdbc441a0aeb5d68a8ce"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="location",["id"]="shadow-council",["kind"]="faction",["newSubject"]=false,["related"]={},["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="faction-source-context-2026-10-26-r1",["text"]="Greta placed the Shadow Council in Jaedenar’s corrupted barrow dens, where she said it plotted with the Burning Legion.",["title"]="The Shadow Council"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"5157:description:1-86","5157:description:91-178","5157:description:180-294","5157:description:296-375","5157:description:380-464","5157:description:466-489","5157:objective:1-124"},["minimumStage"]=2,["questID"]=5157,["sourceHash"]="5447af1f574656f2e381ac0a09687d5ff1d210c966c42cb978315ec5833319b2"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL"},["field"]="context",["id"]="shadow-council",["kind"]="faction",["newSubject"]=false,["related"]={},["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVersion"]="faction-source-context-2026-10-26-r1",["text"]="Protective braziers concealed the Council’s Shadow Hold lair from Greta’s scrying; extinguishing them was her proposed means of learning its leadership.",["title"]="The Shadow Council"},{["evidence"]={["method"]="RETAINED_QUEST_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["narrativeUse"]="REFERENCE_ONLY",["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"8464:description:1-45","8464:description:48-153","8464:description:158-232","8464:description:235-354","8464:description:359-430","8464